{
  "slug": "meta-vr",
  "name": "Meta Vr",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skills for Meta Quest/Horizon OS development. Helps Claude assist with Quest app debugging, performance analysis, VR project setup, Unity, OpenXR, WebXR, Spatial SDK and Platform SDK integration, store submission checks, and adb/hzdb device workflows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **29 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (29): `hz-android-2d-porting` (Guides porting existing Android 2D apps to Meta Quest and Horizon OS — input adaptation, panel layout, and…), `hz-api-upgrade` (Upgrades Meta Quest apps to newer Horizon OS SDK versions — migration guides, deprecated API replacements, changelog), `hz-immersive-designer` (Guides design of comfortable, intuitive VR/MR experiences for Meta Quest and Horizon OS — comfort guidelines, interaction patterns,…), `hz-iwsdk-webxr` (Builds WebXR experiences for Meta Quest and Horizon OS using the Immersive Web SDK (IWSDK) — ECS architecture,…), `hz-new-project-creation` (Scaffolds new Meta Quest and Horizon OS projects with recommended settings for Unity, Unreal, Android/Spatial SDK, or WebXR), `hz-perfetto-debug` (Analyzes Meta Quest and Horizon OS VR performance using Perfetto traces — frame timing, CPU/GPU bottlenecks, render pass…), `hz-platform-sdk` (Guides integration of the Horizon Platform SDK for Meta Quest and Horizon OS Android/Kotlin apps — achievements, IAP,…), `hz-psdk-integration` (For 3P / EXTERNAL developers: guides interactive Horizon Platform SDK (PSDK) integration for Meta Quest and Horizon OS…), and 21 more\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `metavr`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install meta-vr@claude-community` from `meta-quest/agentic-tools`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 29,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Meta Platforms, Inc."
  },
